                                                "sense_id": "c1a1d602-2934-3c83-a5d3-58e99f22536c",
                                                "text": "Anyone who knew our military installation in Okinawa knew it was a room full of gasoline waiting for someone to strike a match. We had forty-two bases on the island with more than twenty thousand personnel. All of them were living and conducting exercises right up against Okinawan civilian neighborhoods."
                                            }
                                        ]
